	// ListChannels List publishing channels
	//
	// Every channel Hermoso can publish to, whether this workspace has it connected, and what each supports (visibilities, carousel limits, caption length). A channel that is NOT connected is still listed, with `connected: false` — "we do not support that" and "you have not connected it" are different answers and a client must be able to tell them apart.
