	// QuoteCloneWithBody Price a clone before running it
	//
	// What cloning an ad for this profile will cost, step by step, before anything runs. `type: image` prices the static clone (`clone_static`): reading the layout (a flat charge) plus the image render’s own hold, with the brand’s product photo attached exactly as the clone attaches it; the copy writing and the final brand check are billed at their real model cost and are listed with `credits: null`. `type: video` prices the first step of a video clone (`clone_video`: watching the original and planning the storyboard) as the server’s own estimate; the render is priced exactly once the plan exists, by calling `render_ad` with `dryRun: true`. Free: nothing is read, reserved or charged.
